<div class="customization-view">
 <header class="page-heading"><h1>Personalización del bot</h1><p>Configura la personalidad de tu agente y la información de tu negocio.</p></header>
 <p id="custom-readonly" class="notice" hidden>Tu plan está en modo de solo lectura. Puedes consultar tu configuración y catálogo.</p>
 <section class="config-card" aria-labelledby="personality-title">
  <div class="card-heading"><span class="section-icon material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">psychology</span><div><h2 id="personality-title">Definir personalidad</h2><p>Tono, estilo e instrucciones de comportamiento</p></div></div>
  <form id="personality-form"><fieldset id="personality-fields">
   <label for="agent-personality">Instrucciones del sistema</label><textarea id="agent-personality" rows="5" placeholder="Ej.: Eres un asistente amable. Saluda con cercanía y recomienda los productos del negocio."></textarea>
   <div class="two-columns"><div><label for="agent-tone">Tono de voz</label><select id="agent-tone"><option value="">Selecciona un tono</option><option value="Amigable y casual">Amigable y casual</option><option value="Profesional">Profesional</option><option value="Cercano y entusiasta">Cercano y entusiasta</option><option value="Formal">Formal</option></select></div><div><label for="agent-language">Idioma principal</label><select id="agent-language"><option value="Español">Español (ES)</option><option value="Inglés">Inglés (EN)</option><option value="Portugués">Portugués (PT)</option></select></div></div>
   <label for="agent-welcome">Mensaje de bienvenida</label><input id="agent-welcome" placeholder="¿Cómo quieres saludar a tus clientes?" maxlength="2000" />
   <div class="form-actions"><button class="primary-button" type="submit" id="save-personality">Guardar personalidad</button></div>
  </fieldset><p id="personality-feedback" class="feedback" role="status" hidden></p></form>
 </section>
 <section class="config-card" id="catalog" aria-labelledby="catalog-title">
  <div class="card-heading catalog-heading"><div class="heading-group"><span class="section-icon material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">restaurant</span><div><h2 id="catalog-title">Cargar menú o catálogo</h2><p>Información de tus productos para atender consultas</p></div></div><div class="tab-switch" role="tablist" aria-label="Modo del catálogo"><button id="list-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="catalog-list">Lista</button><button id="upload-tab" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="catalog-upload" tabindex="-1">Subir archivo</button></div></div>
  <div id="catalog-list" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="list-tab">
   <form id="product-form" class="product-editor"><fieldset id="product-fields"><h3><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">add_circle</span><span id="product-form-title">Añadir producto</span></h3><div class="product-inputs"><div><label class="sr-only" for="product-name">Nombre del producto</label><input id="product-name" placeholder="Nombre del producto" required maxlength="200" /></div><div><label class="sr-only" for="product-price">Precio en pesos colombianos</label><input id="product-price" type="number" min="0" max="9999999999.99" step="0.01" placeholder="Precio (COP)" required /></div><div><label class="sr-only" for="product-description">Descripción breve</label><input id="product-description" placeholder="Descripción breve…" maxlength="2000" /></div><button id="save-product" class="primary-button add-button" type="submit" aria-label="Guardar producto"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">add</span></button></div><button id="cancel-product" class="text-button" type="button" hidden>Cancelar edición</button></fieldset></form>
   <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Producto</th><th>Precio</th><th>Descripción</th><th class="actions-column">Acciones</th></tr></thead><tbody id="catalog-products"></tbody></table><p id="catalog-empty" class="empty-message" hidden>Aún no tienes productos. Añade el primero para empezar tu catálogo.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div id="catalog-upload" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="upload-tab" hidden><form id="catalog-import-form" class="upload-box"><fieldset id="import-fields"><span class="material-symbols-outlined upload-icon" aria-hidden="true">upload_file</span><h3>Importar productos desde un CSV</h3><p>Usa las columnas nombre, precio y descripcion. Hasta 100 productos por archivo. Precios en COP, sin símbolo de moneda.</p><label for="catalog-file">Seleccionar archivo CSV</label><input id="catalog-file" type="file" accept=".csv,text/csv" required /><div class="upload-actions"><button class="text-button" id="download-template" type="button">Descargar plantilla</button><button class="primary-button" type="submit" id="import-products">Importar productos</button></div></fieldset></form></div>
  <p id="catalog-feedback" class="feedback" role="status" hidden></p>
 </section>
</div>
<style>
 .customization-view{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;color:#272e38;padding-top:12px}.page-heading{margin:0 0 28px}.page-heading h1{font-size:28px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.7px;margin:0 0 5px}.page-heading p,.card-heading p{color:#79818a;font-size:14px}.config-card{position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:14px;padding:28px;margin-bottom:28px;box-shadow:0 3px 14px #20283405;overflow:hidden}.config-card:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;width:4px;background:#ff7917}.card-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:26px}.card-heading h2{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 2px;letter-spacing:-.4px}.section-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;width:44px;height:44px;flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid #ffecd6;border-radius:10px;background:#fff9ef;color:#f88321;font-size:26px}.heading-group{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}.catalog-heading{justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}fieldset{border:0;margin:0;padding:0;min-width:0}label{display:block;font-size:13px;font-weight:550;margin-bottom:7px}input,textarea,select{width:100%;border:1px solid #e4e5e9;background:#fafafa;border-radius:9px;padding:12px 16px;font:inherit;font-size:14px;color:#454b54;outline:none;transition:border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s}textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:150px}input:focus,textarea:focus,select:focus{border-color:#ff8b30;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #ff79171a}input::placeholder,textarea::placeholder{color:#858a93}.two-columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin:22px 0}.form-actions{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:24px}button{cursor:pointer;font:inherit}button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #fdba74;outline-offset:3px}.primary-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:#ff7917;color:white;font-size:14px;font-weight:650;padding:13px 24px;box-shadow:0 2px 4px #ff79171a}.primary-button:hover{background:#ed690b}button:disabled,fieldset:disabled .primary-button{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}.tab-switch{display:flex;flex-shrink:0;padding:4px;border-radius:10px;background:#f1f4f8;border:1px solid #edf0f3}.tab-switch button{padding:6px 13px;font-size:12px;border:0;border-radius:7px;color:#7b8490;background:transparent}.tab-switch button[aria-selected=true]{background:#fff;color:#e77c22;font-weight:650;box-shadow:0 1px 4px #2028340a}.product-editor{background:#fafafa;border:1px solid #e7e7e9;border-radius:11px;padding:18px;margin-bottom:18px}h3{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 15px}.product-editor h3{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center}.product-editor h3 .material-symbols-outlined{color:#ed8b37;font-size:20px}.product-inputs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr .9fr 1.3fr auto;gap:12px}.product-inputs input{background:white}.add-button{padding:8px 20px}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid #e4e5e8;border-radius:10px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;text-align:left;font-size:14px}th{background:#f8f9fb;color:#7c8490;font-size:12px;font-weight:550;padding:13px 18px}.table-wrap :global(td){padding:16px 18px;border-top:1px solid #f0f1f3;vertical-align:middle}.table-wrap :global(td:nth-child(2)){white-space:nowrap;color:#737b86}.table-wrap :global(td:nth-child(3)){color:#7e8590;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.actions-column{text-align:right}.table-wrap :global(td:last-child){text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}.table-wrap :global(.row-action){border:0;background:transparent;color:#9198a2;padding:5px}.table-wrap :global(.row-action:hover){color:#f97316}.table-wrap :global(.row-action .material-symbols-outlined){font-size:19px}.text-button{color:#dc701c;border:0;background:transparent;font-size:13px;padding:10px 0}.empty-message{text-align:center;padding:32px;color:#89909a;font-size:14px}.notice,.feedback{padding:12px 16px;margin:12px 0;border:1px solid #fed7aa;border-radius:10px;background:#fff7ed;color:#9a4914;font-size:13px}.feedback[data-kind=error]{border-color:#fdba74}.upload-box{border:1px dashed #edcba8;border-radius:12px;background:#fffbf7;padding:30px;text-align:center}.upload-box p{color:#7e8590;font-size:13px;max-width:580px;margin:0 auto 20px}.upload-icon{font-size:40px;color:#f88a30;margin-bottom:12px}.upload-box input{background:white}.upload-actions{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin-top:18px}[hidden]{display:none!important}@media(max-width:760px){.config-card{padding:22px 18px}.catalog-heading{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.two-columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}.product-inputs{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.product-inputs>div:nth-child(3){grid-column:1/-1}.add-button{grid-column:1/-1}.card-heading h2{font-size:18px}.page-heading h1{font-size:25px}.table-wrap table{min-width:540px}.upload-box{padding:18px}.upload-actions{flex-direction:column}}
</style>
